# Porto SDK TypeScript — contribution

Node ≥20, TypeScript ~5.9. Runtime/build: **porto-data**. Dev/BDD: **porto-features**. Browser entry: package `/browser` subpath (embedded catalog).

1. Read [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md).
2. Do not swap `execution.json` (billing/execution gates) with `graph.edges.wire` (checkout codes).
3. Cross-SDK behavior: coordinate with Python; note parity in the PR.

Architecture: [sdk.mdc](sdk.mdc).

```bash
make          # pnpm install + hooks
make check    # registry + bindings + biome + tsc + unit tests
make sdk      # porto-features @sdk batches
make validate # check + sdk + adapters
```

Heavy: `I_ACCEPT_PAID_API_COST=1 make heavy` / `test-api` only with credentials.

Do not commit: `src/_bundled/`, `artifacts/`, `coverage/`, `node_modules/`.

BDD: `tests/bdd/runner/batches.ts` · `scripts/test/run_bdd_batches.ts` · `tests/bdd/steps/`.
